# Copy to `.env` (Expo dev) or set as environment variables in your hosting
# dashboard (e.g. Vercel project settings). `expo export` inlines these at
# build time, so redeploy/rebuild after changing them.
#
# Base URL of the EcoTrack Express backend, including the `/api` prefix
# (the `/api` suffix is appended automatically if omitted).
